                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a760c9aa-7c70-4ebd-bf77-163d5311b4c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e588bd0-61da-38b1-813a-da83fd1281bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "898a0390-8745-3c4b-8b16-e4ffc7eb0293",
                        "source_sense_description": "geneigd tot twijfel",
                        "target_lang_word": "sceptical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d39149a2-9191-3b09-a2d4-22b2591f37b5",
                                        "entry_id": "9934267b-8e6c-3ef7-bd0f-6977be3db581",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Commonwealth standard spelling of skeptical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42b79e3c-3245-47d7-946f-aedfc8a57517",
                                                "sense_id": "d39149a2-9191-3b09-a2d4-22b2591f37b5",
                                                "text": "But regardless of what they made of phrenology, those who saw craniometry as a means of measuring the relative weight of intelligence and emotion in psychological makeup were generally sceptical as to whether, as Blumenbach and Camper believed, humanity had branched from one ancestral pair into varietal types as a result of colonising different continents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e77be4bc-1005-4810-b6f7-22375b25375d",
                                                "sense_id": "d39149a2-9191-3b09-a2d4-22b2591f37b5",
                                                "text": "And according to Hughes, HM Treasury is still sceptical about rail electrification. \"It's not because they don't see electrification as a good thing, but I think when you look at it from the UK-wide perspective, if you have £x billion to spend on decarbonisation, you don't necessarily start with rail. Rail's not where you get the biggest bang for the buck in terms of decarbonisation.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5be2594c-dfdf-4cb8-a0b1-b51140d4759b",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e588bd0-61da-38b1-813a-da83fd1281bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "898a0390-8745-3c4b-8b16-e4ffc7eb0293",
                        "source_sense_description": "geneigd tot twijfel",
                        "target_lang_word": "skeptical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skeptical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ffc08d4-b577-3294-90ed-696235d049f6",
                                        "entry_id": "22a7a7c5-8f93-371b-9041-80954cb2f4ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having, or expressing doubt; questioning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfabf504-ae63-4c1c-a93d-0e02b8305068",
                                                "sense_id": "0ffc08d4-b577-3294-90ed-696235d049f6",
                                                "text": "My teacher was skeptical when I told her my dog ate my homework."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb010ed7-5677-4dc6-a6a3-6c9fff07a0ed",
                                                "sense_id": "0ffc08d4-b577-3294-90ed-696235d049f6",
                                                "text": "Tom was skeptical when Paul told him that he saw Bigfoot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f9f6da-eb7c-4ed1-a935-62d71fe0e436",
                                                "sense_id": "0ffc08d4-b577-3294-90ed-696235d049f6",
                                                "text": "I can see why people are so skeptical [sic] about him, but I think he's on to something here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5646bfcd-39b0-4fac-8ccb-b4bf20f1e153",
                                                "sense_id": "0ffc08d4-b577-3294-90ed-696235d049f6",
                                                "text": "Numerous experimental tests and other observations have been offered in favor of animal mind reading, and although many scientists are skeptical, others assert that humans are not the only species capable of representing what others do and don’t perceive and know."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8427559d-f023-3b40-ab57-c5c058b38f4f",
                                        "entry_id": "22a7a7c5-8f93-371b-9041-80954cb2f4ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to philosophical skepticism or the skeptics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e5f0904-5885-494a-88a5-e7900879d43f",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e588bd0-61da-38b1-813a-da83fd1281bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "898a0390-8745-3c4b-8b16-e4ffc7eb0293",
                        "source_sense_description": "geneigd tot twijfel",
                        "target_lang_word": "sceptique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                        "entry_id": "8749c681-9d1d-3832-8468-c4b6e4afd617",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les philosophes qui disent qu’il n’y a rien de certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd702c1f-06dd-45fb-91bc-f5659c8147ed",
                                                "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                                "text": "Pyrrhon est considéré comme l’initiateur de la philosophie sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf6e6c82-776a-4c2c-807e-dc279cef786a",
                                                "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                                "text": "Les philosophes sceptiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                        "entry_id": "8749c681-9d1d-3832-8468-c4b6e4afd617",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les personnes qui affectent de douter de tout ce qui n’est pas prouvé d’une manière évidente, incontestable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "common"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca61de6d-023c-4e4c-bc9c-2d83efedc2f2",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "À force de rouler à travers les hommes et les pays, d’en observer les coutumes contraires, ses idées se modifièrent, et il devint sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15e36dd2-65af-4c17-8b08-ac4780cd36d3",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "C’est un homme, un écrivain, un esprit sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "028be6cb-a3cf-467b-ad05-135c748a3d39",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "Être sceptique, rester sceptique : douter d’une chose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cf56e1-c711-4570-8a47-4b19702f685e",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "Cette nouvelle m’a laissé sceptique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                        "entry_id": "a92d89df-d9b4-3b44-809a-dc8b9198f23a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui doute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e8e987d-e764-40e3-8e5c-80dce6c8f795",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "Les subtilités de l’ontologie ont fait tout au plus des sceptiques ; c’est à la connaissance de la nature qu’il était réservé de faire de vrais déistes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd7fc5e-4a56-417a-87bc-dc82d3b40381",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "En tant que sceptiques, nous avons observé qu’en général les gens tiennent à leurs croyances pour des raisons liées à certains besoins émotionnels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b487efc8-84da-430c-8b18-a68f7b297a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "Pyrrhon, bien qu’il n’en souhaitât pas, ni le contraire bien sûr, eut des disciples aux noms différents : les zététiques cherchaient la vérité sans relâche, les sceptiques examinaient tout sans jamais rien trouver, les éphectiques suspendaient leurs jugements, les aporétiques s’affirmaient incertains, y compris de leurs incertitudes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a43c9213-ca7c-34eb-ba33-314cf08e249a",
                                        "entry_id": "a92d89df-d9b4-3b44-809a-dc8b9198f23a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(au féminin) Philosophie pyrrhonienne du doute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0370014e-2e8f-42ac-b8e9-04f358ecc3e2",
                                                "sense_id": "a43c9213-ca7c-34eb-ba33-314cf08e249a",
                                                "text": "Selon cela les doutes de la sceptique établiront le milieu de la vertu intellectuelle, examinant les raisons qui proposent de tous côtés, sans rien déterminer que sur le vraisemblable seulement, et avec sa suspension ordinaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
